      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's more of a a sync issue. Having people leave and join (sometimes) fixed it. \nProblem: 3.0 menu should sync parameters but fails to since newest update.\nExample actions: Change avatar color with a color wheel or toggle objects on and off such as clothing\nExpected results: Color changes, or objects toggle and get synced with all users.\nActual results: Local sees the change, other users get a mixed bag of syncing, some users see it, some don't. For the ones that don't see it, the avatar tends to be stuck in a default state to them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
