      "value": "@{5f99a97e4d4afb3fb6674ca5|full_name}: yeah and me and my friends thought it was possibly working on just the avatar you loaded into the world with first but thats also wrong, sometimes everyone in the room whether new to the room or been for a while can see all the toggles, other times like you say its a mixed bag. Its random, inconsistent, and changes per person.",
