      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Did some testing with some friends, Seems to happen with full body tracking. When you calibrate it fixes it for everyone who saw the calibration. but if anybody new joins they will not be able to see animations until another calibration is done.\nHowever using the Reset option does not fix it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
